upgrade:
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 4.0.2
    component:
      - trigger: zigbee_multi_network_stub
        description: >
          The zigbee_multi_network_stub component has been deprecated. No action is needed.
        remove:
          - zigbee_multi_network_stub
      - trigger: zigbee_multi_pan_stub
        description: >
          The zigbee_multi_pan_stub component has been deprecated. No action is needed.
        remove:
          - zigbee_multi_pan_stub
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 4.1.1
    configuration:
      - script: zigbee/component/scripts/upgrade_zigbee_rtos_stack_size.lua

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 4.2.0
    component:
      - trigger: zigbee_aes_psa
        description: >
          The zigbee_aes_psa component has been deprecated. No action is needed.
        remove:
          - zigbee_aes_psa
      - trigger: zigbee_ccm_psa
        description: >
          The zigbee_ccm_psa component has been deprecated. No action is needed.
        remove:
          - zigbee_ccm_psa
      - trigger: zigbee_security_link_keys_library
        description: >
          The Zigbee Security Link Keys Library component has been removed. The Zigbee Security Link Keys component has been added in its place.
        remove:
          - zigbee_security_link_keys_library
        add:
          - zigbee_security_link_keys
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 4.3.0
    component:
      - trigger: iostream_usart
        description: >
          Switch to use default recommended vcom line (USART/EUSART). No action is needed.
        remove:
          - iostream_usart
          - zigbee_debug_basic
        add:
          - iostream_recommended_stream
      - trigger: iostream_eusart
        description: >
          Switch to use default recommended vcom line (USART/EUSART). No action is needed.
        remove:
          - iostream_eusart
          - zigbee_debug_basic
        add:
          - iostream_recommended_stream
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 4.4.0
    configuration:
      - name: EMBER_GP_PROXY_TABLE_TOKEN_SIZE
        replacement: REMOVED_MACRO
      - name: EMBER_GP_SINK_TABLE_TOKEN_SIZE
        replacement: REMOVED_MACRO
      - script: zigbee/component/scripts/upgrade_gp_table_token_size.lua
    component:
      - trigger: zigbee_end_device_bind
        description: >
          The zigbee_end_device_bind component has been deprecated.  No Action is needed.
        remove:
          - zigbee_end_device_bind
      - trigger: zigbee_install_code
        description: >
          The zigbee_install_code component has been merged into the stack. No action is needed.
        remove:
          - zigbee_install_code
      - trigger: zigbee_binding_table
        description: >
          The zigbee_binding_table component has been merged into the stack. No action is needed.
        remove:
          - zigbee_binding_table
      - trigger: zigbee_packet_validate
        description: >
          The zigbee_packet_validate component has been merged into the stack. No action is needed.
        remove:
          - zigbee_packet_validate

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 2024.6.0
    configuration:
      - name: SL_ZIGBEE_GP_PROXY_TABLE_SIZE
        replacement: REMOVED_MACRO
      - name: SL_ZIGBEE_GP_SINK_TABLE_SIZE
        replacement: REMOVED_MACRO
      - script: zigbee/component/scripts/upgrade_gp_table_token_size.lua
      - script: zigbee/component/scripts/upgrade_remove_packet_buffer_count.lua
      - script: zigbee/component/scripts/zigbee_gsdk_to_sisdk_compatibility.lua

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 2024.12.0
    configuration:
      - name: SL_ZIGBEE_KEY_TABLE_SIZE
        replacement: REMOVED_MACRO
      - script: zigbee/component/scripts/upgrade_key_table_size.lua
      - name: NVM3_DEFAULT_CACHE_SIZE
        replacement: NVM3_DEFAULT_CACHE_SIZE
      - script: zigbee/component/scripts/upgrade_nvm3_default_cache_size.lua
    component:
      - trigger: zigbee_dmp_tuning
        description: >
          The zigbee_dmp_tuning component has been deprecated. radio_priority_15_4 component has taken its place for adjusting 15_4 dmp radio priority.
        remove:
          - zigbee_dmp_tuning

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 2025.6.0
    component:
      - trigger: iostream_recommended_stream
        description: >
          Switched to iostream_recommended_console from iostream_recommended_stream to enable debug logging. No action is needed.
        remove:
          - iostream_recommended_stream
        add:
          - iostream_recommended_console
      - trigger: zigbee_pro_stack_rail_mux
        description: >
          The zigbee_pro_stack_rail_mux component has been replaced with a more flexible zigbee_pro_stack component that automatically includes RAIL MUX support when available. No action is needed
        remove:
          - zigbee_pro_stack_rail_mux
        add:
          - zigbee_pro_stack
      - script: zigbee/component/scripts/upgrade_zigbee_sl_system_compatibliity.lua
        description: >
          In sisdk-2025.6.0 the sl_system component was deprecated and support for baremetal applications has been removed.
          For baremetal applications sl_system_compatibility is now used for a seamless transition.
          For RTOS applications you can manually upgrade your project to sl_main or add the define SL_SUPPRESS_DEPRECATION_WARNINGS_SDK_2025_6 to your project to keep sl_system until it is removed.
          sl_system support for RTOS applications will be removed in sisdk-2026.6.0 and your project will need to upgrade to sl_main.

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 2025.6.2
    component:
      - script: zigbee/component/scripts/upgrade_zigbee_token_manager.lua
        description: >
          The Token Manager component has been added to the project. This is a legacy component that handles the management of tokens. No action is required, but the user is encouraged to read the corresponding zigbee 2025.6 release notes that describe the new Common Token Manager component.

  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: 2025.12.0
    configuration:
      - name: SL_ZIGBEE_AF_PLUGIN_OTA_CLIENT_POLICY_EBL_VERIFICATION
        replacement: SL_ZIGBEE_AF_PLUGIN_OTA_CLIENT_POLICY_GBL_VERIFICATION
        description: >-
          The SL_ZIGBEE_AF_PLUGIN_OTA_CLIENT_POLICY_EBL_VERIFICATION configuration item has been renamed to SL_ZIGBEE_AF_PLUGIN_OTA_CLIENT_POLICY_GBL_VERIFICATION in line with the long-removed EBL file format.
          SL_ZIGBEE_AF_PLUGIN_OTA_CLIENT_POLICY_GBL_VERIFICATION is functionally the same as SL_ZIGBEE_AF_PLUGIN_OTA_CLIENT_POLICY_EBL_VERIFICATION. No action is needed.
